Changelog: 22-11-2026 11:42:28

Added. The Refresh row is now the Screen row. It shows the resolution, scale and refresh rate of the screen the
window is on, as the desktop reports them. A Refresh row you hid stays hidden as the Screen row. The wiki's table
names the new row. test_overlay.py checks the new value.

